  "prefLabel": "We 304.01 Examination Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 304.01 Examination Required.\n\n(a) An applicant shall not be issued a license unless the applicant has passed an examination administered by the board.\n\n(b) No person shall sit for an examination administered by the board unless:\n\n(1) The person has first submitted an application to the board, together with all required documentation and fees, as specified in We 303, above; and\n\n(2) The application has been approved by the board.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for We 300) #12083 eff 3-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
